### Create new exercise
POST http://localhost:8080/api/exercise
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
  "name": "Bench Press",
  "muscleGroup": "Chest",
  "equipment": "Barbell",
  "duration": 60
}

### Get all exercises (list DTO)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/exercise/list

### Get exercise by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/exercise/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111

### Update (PATCH) duration
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/exercise/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "duration": 90
}


### Create new exercise result
POST http://localhost:8080/api/exercise/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111/result
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222",
  "set": 1,
  "reps": 8,
  "weight": 70,
  "personalBest": true
}

### Get all results for exercise
GET http://localhost:8080/api/exercise/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111/result

### Get single result
GET http://localhost:8080/api/exercise/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111/result/22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222

### Update (PATCH) weight
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/exercise/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111/result/22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "weight": 75
}

### Delete result
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/exercise/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111/result/22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222

### Delete exercise
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/exercise/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111

### Try to create exercise with existing ID (should return 409 Conflict)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/exercise
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
  "name": "Duplicate Press",
  "muscleGroup": "Chest",
  "equipment": "Barbell",
  "duration": 30
}

### Try to get non-existing exercise (should return 404)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/exercise/99999999-9999-9999-9999-999999999999

### Try to create result for non-existing exercise (should return 404)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/exercise/99999999-9999-9999-9999-999999999999/results
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "88888888-8888-8888-8888-888888888888",
  "set": 1,
  "reps": 10,
  "weight": 100,
  "personalBest": false
}